{
  "$comment": [
    "THE sx VOCABULARY. One table. The lint validates against it, the lowering emits from",
    "it, and the TS types / docs reference / LSP completions / agent SKILL.md all generate",
    "from it. Adding a property is one row here, not a code change in four places.",
    "",
    "NAMES are Tailwind's — the prior every agent already has, and terse (an agent pays for",
    "every character). VALUES are ours: a token from a scale, or a CSS keyword. Never a raw",
    "number, never a colour, never a unit.",
    "",
    "  scale:    the value IS a design decision. A token from that scale, and nothing else.",
    "  keywords: the value is physics. The CSS keywords — all of them, no allowlist.",
    "",
    "The allowlist was the mistake. The value discipline is the point.",
    "",
    "Several utilities SHARE a name and disambiguate by value, exactly as Tailwind does:",
    "text-sm is a font size, text-foreground is a colour, text-center is an alignment. The",
    "engine picks the entry whose value-set contains the value.",
    "",
    "Scales live in Rust (tokens.rs) because they carry the var() templates and are few and",
    "stable. Utilities live here because they are many and grow."
  ],

  "utilities": [
    { "name": "p",  "css": ["padding"], "scale": "space" },
    { "name": "px", "css": ["padding-inline"], "scale": "space" },
    { "name": "py", "css": ["padding-block"], "scale": "space" },
    { "name": "pt", "css": ["padding-top"], "scale": "space" },
    { "name": "pr", "css": ["padding-right"], "scale": "space" },
    { "name": "pb", "css": ["padding-bottom"], "scale": "space" },
    { "name": "pl", "css": ["padding-left"], "scale": "space" },
    { "name": "ps", "css": ["padding-inline-start"], "scale": "space" },
    { "name": "pe", "css": ["padding-inline-end"], "scale": "space" },

    { "name": "m",  "css": ["margin"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "mx", "css": ["margin-inline"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "my", "css": ["margin-block"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "mt", "css": ["margin-top"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "mr", "css": ["margin-right"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "mb", "css": ["margin-bottom"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "ml", "css": ["margin-left"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "ms", "css": ["margin-inline-start"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "me", "css": ["margin-inline-end"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },

    { "name": "inset",   "css": ["inset"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "inset-x", "css": ["inset-inline"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "inset-y", "css": ["inset-block"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "top",     "css": ["top"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "right",   "css": ["right"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "bottom",  "css": ["bottom"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },
    { "name": "left",    "css": ["left"], "scale": "space", "keywords": ["auto"], "negatable": true },

    { "name": "w",     "css": ["width"], "scale": "size" },
    { "name": "min-w", "css": ["min-width"], "scale": "size" },
    { "name": "max-w", "css": ["max-width"], "scale": "size" },
    { "name": "h",     "css": ["height"], "scale": "size" },
    { "name": "min-h", "css": ["min-height"], "scale": "size" },
    { "name": "max-h", "css": ["max-height"], "scale": "size" },
    { "name": "size",  "css": ["width", "height"], "scale": "size" },
    { "name": "basis", "css": ["flex-basis"], "scale": "size" },
    { "name": "aspect", "css": ["aspect-ratio"], "map": { "square": "1 / 1", "video": "16 / 9", "auto": "auto" } },

    { "name": "bg",     "css": ["background-color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "text",   "css": ["color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "border", "css": ["border-color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "border-t", "css": ["border-top-color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "border-r", "css": ["border-right-color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "border-b", "css": ["border-bottom-color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "border-l", "css": ["border-left-color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "outline", "css": ["outline-color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "fill",   "css": ["fill"], "scale": "color", "keywords": ["none", "currentColor"] },
    { "name": "stroke", "css": ["stroke"], "scale": "color", "keywords": ["none", "currentColor"] },
    { "name": "caret",  "css": ["caret-color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "accent", "css": ["accent-color"], "scale": "color", "keywords": ["auto"] },
    { "name": "decoration", "css": ["text-decoration-color"], "scale": "color" },
    { "name": "ring",   "css": ["box-shadow"], "scale": "ring" },

    { "name": "text",     "css": ["font-size"], "scale": "text" },
    { "name": "font",     "css": ["font-family"], "scale": "font" },
    { "name": "font",     "css": ["font-weight"], "scale": "weight" },
    { "name": "leading",  "css": ["line-height"], "scale": "leading" },
    { "name": "tracking", "css": ["letter-spacing"], "scale": "tracking" },
    { "name": "indent",   "css": ["text-indent"], "scale": "space" },
    { "name": "text",     "css": ["text-align"], "keywords": ["left", "center", "right", "justify", "start", "end"] },
    { "name": "whitespace", "css": ["white-space"], "keywords": ["normal", "nowrap", "pre", "pre-line", "pre-wrap", "break-spaces"] },
    { "name": "break",    "css": ["overflow-wrap", "word-break"], "map": { "normal": "normal", "words": "anywhere", "all": "break-all", "keep": "keep-all" } },
    { "name": "list",     "css": ["list-style-type"], "keywords": ["none", "disc", "decimal"] },
    { "name": "align",    "css": ["vertical-align"], "keywords": ["baseline", "top", "middle", "bottom", "text-top", "text-bottom", "sub", "super"] },

    { "bare": true, "css": ["text-transform"], "map": { "uppercase": "uppercase", "lowercase": "lowercase", "capitalize": "capitalize", "normal-case": "none" } },
    { "bare": true, "css": ["font-style"], "map": { "italic": "italic", "not-italic": "normal" } },
    { "bare": true, "css": ["text-decoration-line"], "map": { "underline": "underline", "overline": "overline", "line-through": "line-through", "no-underline": "none" } },
    { "bare": true, "css": ["font-variant-numeric"], "map": { "ordinal": "ordinal", "slashed-zero": "slashed-zero", "lining-nums": "lining-nums", "oldstyle-nums": "oldstyle-nums", "proportional-nums": "proportional-nums", "tabular-nums": "tabular-nums", "normal-nums": "normal" } },
    { "bare": true, "atom": "truncate", "decls": [["overflow", "hidden"], ["text-overflow", "ellipsis"], ["white-space", "nowrap"]] },
    { "bare": true, "atom": "sr-only", "decls": [["position", "absolute"], ["width", "1px"], ["height", "1px"], ["padding", "0"], ["margin", "-1px"], ["overflow", "hidden"], ["clip-path", "inset(50%)"], ["white-space", "nowrap"], ["border-width", "0"]] },

    { "name": "rounded",   "css": ["border-radius"], "scale": "radius" },
    { "name": "rounded-t", "css": ["border-start-start-radius", "border-start-end-radius"], "scale": "radius" },
    { "name": "rounded-b", "css": ["border-end-start-radius", "border-end-end-radius"], "scale": "radius" },
    { "name": "rounded-l", "css": ["border-start-start-radius", "border-end-start-radius"], "scale": "radius" },
    { "name": "rounded-r", "css": ["border-start-end-radius", "border-end-end-radius"], "scale": "radius" },
    { "name": "border",   "css": ["border-width"], "scale": "border-width" },
    { "name": "border-t", "css": ["border-top-width"], "scale": "border-width" },
    { "name": "border-r", "css": ["border-right-width"], "scale": "border-width" },
    { "name": "border-b", "css": ["border-bottom-width"], "scale": "border-width" },
    { "name": "border-l", "css": ["border-left-width"], "scale": "border-width" },
    { "name": "border",   "css": ["border-style"], "keywords": ["solid", "dashed", "dotted", "double", "hidden", "none"] },
    { "name": "outline",  "css": ["outline-width"], "scale": "border-width" },
    { "name": "outline",  "css": ["outline-style"], "keywords": ["none", "solid", "dashed", "dotted", "double"] },
    { "name": "outline-offset", "css": ["outline-offset"], "scale": "space" },

    { "name": "shadow",  "css": ["box-shadow"], "scale": "shadow" },
    { "name": "opacity", "css": ["opacity"], "scale": "opacity" },
    { "name": "mix-blend", "css": ["mix-blend-mode"], "keywords": ["normal", "multiply", "screen", "overlay", "darken", "lighten", "difference", "exclusion", "luminosity"] },
    { "bare": true, "css": ["isolation"], "map": { "isolate": "isolate", "isolation-auto": "auto" } },

    { "name": "transition", "css": ["transition-property"], "map": { "none": "none", "all": "all", "colors": "color, background-color, border-color, outline-color, fill, stroke", "opacity": "opacity", "shadow": "box-shadow", "transform": "transform, translate, scale, rotate" } },
    { "name": "duration",   "css": ["transition-duration"], "scale": "duration" },
    { "name": "ease",       "css": ["transition-timing-function"], "scale": "ease" },
    { "name": "delay",      "css": ["transition-delay"], "scale": "duration" },

    { "name": "rotate",      "css": ["rotate"], "scale": "angle", "negatable": true },
    { "name": "scale",       "css": ["scale"], "scale": "percent" },
    { "name": "translate-x", "css": ["translate"], "scale": "space", "negatable": true, "axis": "x" },
    { "name": "translate-y", "css": ["translate"], "scale": "space", "negatable": true, "axis": "y" },
    { "name": "origin",      "css": ["transform-origin"], "map": { "center": "center", "top": "top", "top-right": "top right", "right": "right", "bottom-right": "bottom right", "bottom": "bottom", "bottom-left": "bottom left", "left": "left", "top-left": "top left" } },

    { "bare": true, "css": ["display"], "map": { "block": "block", "inline-block": "inline-block", "inline": "inline", "hidden": "none", "contents": "contents", "flow-root": "flow-root", "list-item": "list-item" } },
    { "bare": true, "css": ["position"], "map": { "static": "static", "relative": "relative", "absolute": "absolute", "fixed": "fixed", "sticky": "sticky" } },
    { "bare": true, "css": ["visibility"], "map": { "visible": "visible", "invisible": "hidden", "collapse": "collapse" } },
    { "name": "z",          "css": ["z-index"], "scale": "z", "keywords": ["auto"] },
    { "name": "overflow",   "css": ["overflow"], "keywords": ["auto", "hidden", "clip", "visible", "scroll"] },
    { "name": "overflow-x", "css": ["overflow-x"], "keywords": ["auto", "hidden", "clip", "visible", "scroll"] },
    { "name": "overflow-y", "css": ["overflow-y"], "keywords": ["auto", "hidden", "clip", "visible", "scroll"] },
    { "name": "object",     "css": ["object-fit"], "keywords": ["contain", "cover", "fill", "none", "scale-down"] },
    { "name": "object",     "css": ["object-position"], "map": { "center": "center", "top": "top", "right": "right", "bottom": "bottom", "left": "left" } },
    { "name": "box",        "css": ["box-sizing"], "map": { "border": "border-box", "content": "content-box" } },

    { "name": "grow",   "css": ["flex-grow"], "keywords": ["0", "1"] },
    { "name": "shrink", "css": ["flex-shrink"], "keywords": ["0", "1"] },
    { "name": "order",  "css": ["order"], "map": { "first": "-9999", "last": "9999", "none": "0" } },
    { "name": "self",   "css": ["align-self"], "map": { "auto": "auto", "start": "flex-start", "center": "center", "end": "flex-end", "stretch": "stretch", "baseline": "baseline" } },
    { "name": "justify-self", "css": ["justify-self"], "keywords": ["auto", "start", "center", "end", "stretch"] },

    { "name": "cursor", "css": ["cursor"], "keywords": ["auto", "default", "pointer", "wait", "text", "move", "help", "not-allowed", "none", "context-menu", "progress", "cell", "crosshair", "vertical-text", "alias", "copy", "no-drop", "grab", "grabbing", "all-scroll", "col-resize", "row-resize", "n-resize", "e-resize", "s-resize", "w-resize", "ew-resize", "ns-resize", "zoom-in", "zoom-out"] },
    { "name": "select", "css": ["user-select"], "keywords": ["none", "text", "all", "auto"] },
    { "name": "pointer-events", "css": ["pointer-events"], "keywords": ["none", "auto"] },
    { "name": "touch",  "css": ["touch-action"], "keywords": ["auto", "none", "pan-x", "pan-y", "pinch-zoom", "manipulation"] },
    { "name": "resize", "css": ["resize"], "map": { "none": "none", "y": "vertical", "x": "horizontal", "both": "both" } },
    { "name": "appearance", "css": ["appearance"], "keywords": ["none", "auto"] },
    { "name": "scroll", "css": ["scroll-behavior"], "keywords": ["auto", "smooth"] },
    { "name": "will-change", "css": ["will-change"], "keywords": ["auto", "scroll-position", "contents", "transform"] },
    { "name": "contain", "css": ["contain"], "keywords": ["none", "content", "strict", "size", "layout", "paint"] }
  ],

  "refused": {
    "$comment": "An author must tell a PRINCIPLE from a TODO. Every refusal names its replacement — the mission is never 'find another way', it is always 'use this'.",
    "flex": "<row> — a layout context is a layout element",
